{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44827","headline":"喜严侍御蜀还赠严秘书 · 清江","name":"喜严侍御蜀还赠严秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年分首出咸秦，木落花开秋又春。\n江客不曾知蜀路，旅魂何处访情人。\n当时望月思文友，今日迎骢见近臣。\n多羡二龙同汉代，绣衣芸阁共荣亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}